{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262C4GBCaj6r1794909339.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本群馬縣前橋市，一名男子被熊襲擊受傷，當局捕獲一隻幼熊。</p><p></p><p>警方和消防當地下午1時許，在一條河道發現一隻幼熊，並展開捕捉行動，嘗試撒網捕捉，但幼熊多次逃走。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ldS7IC40z11794909499.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>日本放送協會報道，該隻幼熊被麻醉槍射中，之後被捕獲。當局周二清晨5時許接報，指在前橋市一處民居附近，發現一隻成年熊和幼熊，接近一輛車並損壞車身，其後在早上7時許再次接報，指一名50多歲的男子被熊襲擊，頭部和身體其他部位受傷，該男子被送院治療，沒有生命危險。</p><p></p><p>至於另一隻成年熊仍未找到，當局呼籲民眾保持警惕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:52:40.940205+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T19:53:14.075489+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:46:00.352138+00:00","content_hash":"deaebb0b5f94a3e3cefee8327d9196fa9073e97e358be016cafd07c8594e4691","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}